      <li><a href="https://console.redhat.com/openshift/assisted-installer/clusters/~new">Red Hat Hybrid Cloud Console</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://docs.oracle.com/iaas/Content/openshift-on-oci/openshift-troubleshooting.htm">Troubleshooting OpenShift Container Platform on OCI (Oracle documentation)</a></li>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/installing/installing_on_prem_assisted/installing-on-prem-assisted#installing-on-prem-assisted">Installing an on-premise cluster using the Assisted Installer</a></li>
      </ul>
